[Night bridge]
{Instrumental. Clearly contrasting syncopated bass and electric piano groove, with short distorted guitar lead phrases. Use Dorian melodic color and a different}
{rhythmic pattern.}

[Final guitar lead]
{Instrumental. Return with an evolved main riff, expressive guitar solo answered by saxophone, drum fills and harmonic turnaround. End in tempo, leading directly}
{to the opening riff.}
